{% Shared slides for courses that average individual and optional group attempts. Keep point values and timing in the course deck. %}

=== layout: one-panel

# *Optional Group Quizzes*

@body

- Complete the individual attempt first.
- If you also take the group quiz, your quiz score is the average of your two attempts.
- If you skip the group quiz, your individual score is your final quiz score.
- Tell me before the quiz if you need to discuss an absence.

=== layout: one-panel

# *Low Quiz Grades*

@body

- How can I do better in this class?
- Complete the relevant assignments before taking the quiz.
- If you can retry an assignment, keep practicing until you understand how to answer the questions.
